        "jp": "この世界にはまだ解明されていない謎が\r\nいくつもあるんだけど……。\r\nそれを解くきっかけになるかもしれない。",
        "official_en": "That might hold the key to unraveling several unexplained mysteries of the world.",
        "real_en": "There are still so many mysteries in this world we haven't solved... This could give us a clue to some of them."
